WEBVTT

00:11:52.964 --> 00:12:00.004
and declaring that we can
end child marriage in a generation.

00:12:00.677 --> 00:12:02.860
This is the moment

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:07.294
where a girl and a girl,
and millions of girls worldwide,

00:12:07.294 --> 00:12:09.895
will be able to say,

00:12:09.895 --> 00:12:13.099
"I will marry when I want."

00:12:13.099 --> 00:12:16.144
(Applause)

00:12:23.284 --> 00:12:25.219
Thank you. (Applause)